                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On September 25, 1951, the Secretaries of State and Defense submitted to the
                    National Security Council the First Quarterly Progress Report on NSC 48/5.
                    Several sections of this report deal with United States policy toward Japan. For
                    text, see <ref target="#pg80">page 80</ref>.</p>
            </div>
